@obverse
1. um-ma a-šur₃-mu-ta-pi₃-il₅-ma
#tr.en.(o 3): Thus (says) Aššur-mūtappil, to Kunnaniya speak:
2. a-na ku-na-ni-a
3. qi₂-bi₄-ma ṭup-pe₃-e
4. ša na-zi u₃
#tr.en.(b.e. 1): (Regarding) the tablets, which Nazi and Ilum-bānī brought to you to entrust to you, wherever you sleep, place them in a secure space!
5. DINGIR-ba-ni u₂-bu-lu-ni-ki-ni-ma
6. i-pa₂-qi₂-du-ni-ki-ni
7. a-šar ta-ti₂-ni-li-ni
8. šu-uk-ni-šu-nu-ma
@bottom
1. ša-ṣi₂-ri